- Read-only. Do NOT run any bd or dolt command. Do NOT edit/write files. Do NOT post anything to GitHub (no gh pr comment/review/merge/close) — this pass only assesses.
- Work from /var/home/matt/dev/mybd. Upstream repo: gastownhall/beads — always pass --repo gastownhall/beads to gh. Beads source clone: bd-main/ (git -C bd-main ...; upstream remote = gastownhall/beads). Do not create refs; use gh pr diff, or fetch to FETCH_HEAD only.
